\/h2><\/h1><\/div><div class=\"fusion-text fusion-text-1\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">At Eleanor Gail we specialise in creating unique and beautiful weddings, events and special occasions that exceed our client\u2019s expectations. We believe in rule-free planning, putting the client\u2019s vision and ideas at the centre of our creative to ensure we deliver exceptional private and corporate events.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Whether you need help with wedding planning, private parties or corporate events we provide first class, luxury experiences from conception to delivery, working in collaboration with you and our enviable supplier list. Constantly looking for new trends, unorthodox in our approach and unapologetically client focused, we strive for excellence and professionalism in everything we do.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Our Headquarters are based in Swansea in South Wales but we regularly travel for our clients producing unique weddings and events along the M4 corridor, covering Swansea, Cardiff, Newport, Carmarthen, Brecon, Hereford, Bristol, Reading, The South West of England and beyond.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Eleanor Gail is led by Gail Windley who with her team, transform venues from stately homes to marquees into the most amazing spaces, bringing your event to life and setting the tone for your special occasion. By choosing Wedding &amp; Event Planner Eleanor Gail, you can relax knowing your celebration will be flawless in execution and finished beautifully.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Most of our clients enjoy our full planning service but we enjoy and embrace a fluid way of working to tailor our services to suit you. From On the Day Coordination and Management, Venue Search and Creative Wedding and Event Design, we take the pressure out of planning.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Our goal is to deliver breathtakingly beautiful bespoke events for you and your guests to enjoy. If you\u2019